do_1 = "In apps/launchpad/web/src/widgets/create-chain/chain-storage.ts:18 separate editable-draft freshness from validation of an immutable submitted draft: saveSubmission (:40), static restoreSubmission (:55), the instance restore (:51) and clearSubmission (:71) must accept otherwise valid confirm and reverted records regardless of elapsed age, including a reverted update after a delayed confirmation; preserve the reviewed snapshot and timestamp, schema/version, creator, root-chain, tier, fee-share, timestamp validity, hash, phase, bond and size checks and owner/hash matching on clear, and retain the 30-day expiry for saveDraft (:29) and restoreDraft (:33)."
