do_3 = "Within that same focused test, assert an unsent draft remains restorable at exactly 30 days and rejects at 30 days plus 1 ms, a fresh editable draft can be saved and restored after clearing the aged terminal-reverted record, and malformed journal identity, chain, timestamp, tier, fee share, hash, phase and bond remain rejected without deleting stored bytes; preserve the existing expiry assertions at apps/launchpad/web/src/widgets/create-chain/chain-domain.test.ts:30 and :48 and the confirmation scope checks at chain-adapters.ts:147, whose read-only receipt path (:155) already permits delayed confirmation."
